<translate>
==== RainFactor ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Modifier for the rate at which water enters this item when it rains. The object must be able to store water.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RainFactor = 0.8,
</syntaxhighlight>
